          <attvalue for="34" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Escalating geopolitical tension around Hormuz strengthens national-security framing in Washington and allied capitals, prompting accelerated export controls, sanctions screening and tighter review of cross-border AI financing and technology transfers aimed at China." />
