          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A surge in effective drone strikes in Ukraine prompts governments to tighten export controls on dual‑use drone, guidance and sensor components, and trading partners (including China) respond by enacting or reinforcing stricter outbound controls to limit proliferation." />
