          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Faster expansion of aggregate compute enables quicker training and dissemination of advanced perception, guidance and swarm-control models that are repurposed for weaponized drones, increasing their operational autonomy, sortie rates and lethality on the battlefield." />
