          <attvalue for="28" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.75" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Tighter export controls and enforcement on AI-related technology provoke reciprocal restrictions, public accusations and targeted sanctions between the US and China that spill over into harder rhetoric and posturing by regional actors around Hormuz." />
