          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Tighter export controls and regulatory enforcement on AI models, chips and tooling reduce the flow of high-end autonomy components and software to Russian procurement networks, degrading the tempo and effectiveness of newly fielded UAVs and lowering strike frequency over ensuing deployment cycles." />
