          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Public regulatory measures, sanctions and export restrictions by major powers signal technological decoupling and raise expectations among regional actors and markets that support lines and escalation-containment mechanisms may deteriorate, increasing perceived likelihood of broader conflict spillover." />
