          <attvalue for="34" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="An uptick in Chinese maritime militarization (more patrols, exercises, and forward-deployed assets) triggers reciprocal deployments and sharper diplomatic warnings from the US and regional partners, directly elevating geopolitical tensions surrounding the Strait of Hormuz." />
