          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Faster-than-expected monetary tightening in major currencies raises borrowing costs and amplifies sanctions effectiveness and fiscal pressure on sanctioned regional actors, increasing incentives to undertake maritime harassment or attacks as pressure-release or asymmetric retaliation." />
