          <attvalue for="34" value="0.65" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Sustained monetary tightening in major demand centers depresses industrial and transport activity and lowers crude and refined-product demand, which reduces volumes that exporters (including Russian exporters) can place into seaborne shipment markets." />
