          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Sustained large-scale FX and asset-market interventions consume foreign-currency reserves and constrain import financing for high-value capex (tools, EUV-equipment), causing delays or cancellations of fab upgrades and thereby slowing growth in operational semiconductor capacity." />
