          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A surge in safe-haven flows (flight into USD/Treasuries) strengthens the dollar and tightens external financing for Gulf states, increasing economic pressure on those governments and prompting more aggressive diplomatic and military posturing around the Strait." />
